{"title":"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 76","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_76&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>During the car ride home, Michael looks back at his recent math exams. A problem on Michael's calculus mid-term gets him starting thinking about a particular quadratic, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/1/7e1bde2cd972764c659210041f9aa01e22922376.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2-sx+p,\\]\" width=\"94\" height=\"18\" /> with roots <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/c/adc143c3f887fa7e92fd80d91bb22af51b4abd77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/4/0b4f3f4b698ce35667432041e168f7653533fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" />. He notices that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/6/d6688a7f5d0cb650cef1f075111857ab7f99944c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[r_1+r_2=r_1^2+r_2^2=r_1^3+r_2^3=\\cdots=r_1^{2007}+r_2^{2007}.\\]\" width=\"378\" height=\"19\" /> He wonders how often this is the case, and begins exploring other quantities associated with the roots of such a quadratic. He sets out to compute the greatest possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/f/a6ffe7f6baea568d8464907fdc7411ef13cc433d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\dfrac1{r_1^{2008}}+\\dfrac1{r_2^{2008}}.\\]\" width=\"103\" height=\"41\" /> Help Michael by computing this maximum.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_76&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Vieta%27s_Formulas\" title=\"Vieta&#39;s Formulas\">Vieta's Formulas</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/d/e1dc9adb343409eaefc71e5abaed0e131b2f2484.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r_1 + r_2 = s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"86\" height=\"13\" />. That means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/1/781f61e144e46201bc09275cb5c07af6eee9ae3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r_1^2 + r_2^2 = s^2 - 2p = s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"167\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/b/d7b15a4e82c4f098b1a212f83feec2556b50fff0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r_1^3 + r_1^3 = (r_1 + r_2)^3 - 3r_1^2r_2 - 3r_1r_2^2 = s^3 - 3ps$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"368\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nNote that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/0/5f07227078680754048383ccd9cd799c68720ec5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s = s^2 - 2p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"89\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/8/0d83842986268adf5670524d9677f35ead251bc0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p = \\frac{s^2 - s}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"83\" height=\"39\" />. We also know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/0/6f0c3ca730cb8ec6fc9973d2675d72e153dea334.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s = s^3 - 3ps$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"97\" height=\"18\" />, so substituting for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> results in\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/d/0dd149df2d7accd949bfc27c7b7b921773d2496f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} s &amp;= s^3 - 3s \\cdot \\frac{s^2 - s}{2} \\\\ s &amp;= s^3 - \\tfrac32 s^3 + \\tfrac32 s^2 \\\\ 0 &amp;= -\\tfrac12 s^3 + \\tfrac32 s^2 - s \\\\ 0 &amp;= s^3 - 3s^2 + 2s \\\\ &amp;= s(s-2)(s-1) \\end{align*}\" width=\"152\" height=\"145\" />\n</p><p>Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/3/8d3dea8b71e413dbb0661b3fc9873e3876a1c87e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s = 0,1,2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/1/231cd70adaea591bac095e7290c91c1e9d41d8a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/0/d40a90c6b47ac3e17fe509ea16e9f59d6cfdab32.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s = 0$\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/8/868c0cce47ca5e001d017eaf95b3a9b31c7b292e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" />. However, both cases result in one root being zero, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/b/6fb0e4d77f488c561f25c48d67d027279a58e3ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac1{r_1^{2008}}+\\dfrac1{r_2^{2008}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"100\" height=\"41\" /> is undefined. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/e/d0e9607980bf6edb47c5b72623d1b1f86d148929.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s = 2$\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/1/361ea4cb174e2c033a0a888475e35613e4aa3765.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />, making both roots equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/f/14f8a2e90e73f9fc40fe7cd27173e53331b87390.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1^n = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"50\" height=\"13\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/f/2cff38c09a8369067a137aa0e610b1bb4540c338.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\le n \\le 2007$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"104\" height=\"15\" />, this result satisfies all conditions. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/c/51c3574e434dcfbfb73d434b1d3108270db9db4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac1{r_1^{2008}}+\\dfrac1{r_2^{2008}} = 1+1 = \\boxed{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"212\" height=\"41\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_76&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest\" title=\"2008 iTest\">2008 iTest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems\">(Problems)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_75\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 75\">Problem 75</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_77\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 77\">Problem 77</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/